            "text": "{\"events\":[{\"id\":\"694944dfe2a46d3df0975099\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"THE MUSIC ROOM: Sands Films Cinema Club online presentation\",\"description\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">This page is to obtain access to the broadcast of this Sands Films Cinema Club presentation</p><h1 class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\\\">New Year Special:</span><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\\\">Let's start the year with poetry.</strong></h1><p><br></p><p>As credits roll, the opening shot of&nbsp;<em>Jalsaghar</em>, Satyajit Ray’s study of fading Bengal aristocracy, social self-delusion, and pride, mesmerizes. In a pitch-dark room, only a heavy, ornate, grandiose chandelier is visible. The thing sways, like an erratic pendulum. The camera approaches gradually, until the gleaming fixture fills the screen. A dissolve replaces the image with a tight closeup of the pudgy face of a man, landlord Biswambhar Roy, from which the camera slightly withdraws. He is seated on his terrace. The blankness of his expression suggests eyes that have turned inward—not in contemplation, but nostalgia: Roy gluts on memories of wealth and position.</p><h2><span class=\\\"ql-size-huge\\\">The Music Room</span></h2><p>An aging, decadent landlord’s passion for music becomes the undoing of his legacy as he sacrifices his wealth in order to compete with the opulent music room of his younger, richer neighbour.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><ul><li><em>Year:</em></li><li>1958</li><li><em>Runtime:</em></li><li>100&nbsp;minutes</li><li><em>Language:</em></li><li>Bengali</li><li><em>Director:</em></li><li>Satyajit Ray</li><li><em>Screenwriter:</em></li><li>Satyajit Ray, Santi P. Choudhury</li><li><em>Producer:</em></li><li>Satyajit Ray</li><li><em>Cast:</em></li><li>Chhabi Biswas, Gangapada Basu, Kali Sarkar</li><li><em>Cinematographer:</em></li><li>Subrata Mitra</li><li><em>Editor:</em></li><li>Dulal Dutta</li><li><em>Production Design:</em></li><li>Bansi Chandragupta</li><li><em>Composer:</em></li><li>Ustad Vilayat Khan, Robin Majumdar</li></ul><p><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p>\",\"short_description\":\"Satyajit Ray’s poetical study of fading Bengal aristocracy\",\"venue\":{},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-01-06T19:30:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-02-09T21:30:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6949467c49fb56a847efccaf\",\"name\":\"Indian Cinema\",\"color\":\"#586165\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"trailer_url\":\"\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity\":0,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"694944dfe2a46d3df097509a\",\"name\":\"Watch online, Please make a donation to help us cover costs.\",\"price\":100,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity_sold\":28,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":9007199254740991,\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"max_quantity_per_person\":null,\"variable_price\":true,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"694944dfe2a46d3df09750a0\",\"type\":\"livestream\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"Sands Films Studio\",\"owner_id\":\"60b1303f5955f7009b7cdff3\",\"name\":\"THE MUSIC ROOM: Sands Films Cinema Club online presentation\",\"sort_key\":\"MUSIC ROOM: Sands Films Cinema Club online presentation, THE\",\"short_description\":\"Satyajit Ray’s poetical study of fading Bengal aristocracy\",\"unballoted\":true,\"details\":{},\"credits\":{},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"virtual_content\":{\"id\":\"694944dfe2a46d3df09750a2\",\"type\":\"livestream\",\"status\":\"livestream_not_created\",\"export_status\":\"export_not_requested\",\"livestream_ingest_urls\":[],\"livestream_preview_first\":true,\"livestream_transcription_enabled\":false,\"livestream_premium_enabled\":false,\"live_chat_visible\":true,\"live_chat_participation_enabled\":true,\"live_chat_show_viewer_count\":true,\"ams_drm_enabled\":false,\"created_at\":\"2025-12-22T13:17:19.642Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-22T13:17:19.642Z\",\"platform\":\"eventive\",\"caption_tracks\":[]},\"start_time\":\"2026-01-06T20:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-01-06T22:55:00.000Z\",\"created_at\":\"2025-12-22T13:17:19.627Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-22T13:17:19.627Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true,\"livestream_mode\":\"embedded\",\"livestream_embed_code\":\"<div itemscope itemtype=\\\"https://schema.org/VideoObject\\\" style=\\\"position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;\\\"><meta itemprop=\\\"name\\\" content=\\\"The Music Room (1958)\\\"><meta itemprop=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"This is the live stream from Sands Films Cinema Club\\\"><meta itemprop=\\\"uploadDate\\\" content=\\\"2026-01-06T19:39:09.000Z\\\"><meta itemprop=\\\"thumbnailUrl\\\" content=\\\"https://s2.dmcdn.net/v/ZmmhM1fNOfDwuYYrG/x180\\\"><meta itemprop=\\\"duration\\\" content=\\\"P8268S\\\"><meta itemprop=\\\"embedUrl\\\" content=\\\"https://geo.dailymotion.com/player/x15jgk.html?video=kFKRvuNzbTFRxdEBtt4\\\"><iframe frameborder=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;left:0px;top:0px;overflow:hidden;\\\" src=\\\"https://geo.dailymotion.com/player/x15jgk.html?video=kFKRvuNzbTFRxdEBtt4&playlist=x7ilc3\\\" allowfullscreen allow=\\\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; web-share\\\" title=\\\"Dailymotion video player – The Music Room (1958)\\\"></iframe></div>\"}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-06T22:20:14.499Z\",\"is_virtual\":true,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":true,\"allow_preorder\":true,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_closed\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"virtual_balloting_consolidated\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":false,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":false,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":false,\"virtual_show_donate_prompt\":true,\"virtual_donate_message\":\"Support Sands Films Cinema Club and help cover our costs with an optional donation.\",\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[{\"url\":null,\"image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/3f26c3d9473268f5702aea665190f4d7.png\"}],\"images\":{\"still\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1766410206077temp-1766410206040-default.jpg\"},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p><strong>Thank you for booking this online presentation.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>The link will be live some 15 minutes before the advertised time; it will remain active for 7 days for you to complete watching.</strong></p><p><strong>The Cinema Club has an alternative back up stream here: </strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sandsfilms.co.uk/the-cinema-club/next-screening-watch-live.html\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><strong>https://www.sandsfilms.co.uk/the-cinema-club/next-screening-watch-live.html</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Please feel free to send feedbacks, comments or complaints:</u> filmclub@sandsfilms.co.uk</strong></p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"694ecf35b5cfb77777041866\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"FREE CINEMA: Sands Films Cinema Club online presentation\",\"description\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">This page is to obtain access to the broadcast of this Sands Films Cinema Club presentation</p><h1 class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>1956: FREE CINEMA</strong></h1><p><br></p><p>70 years ago,&nbsp;the Free Cinema manifesto was written by&nbsp;Lindsay Anderson, Lorenza Mazzetti and Karel Reisz to introduce a series of short films at the London’s National Film Theatre in February 1956. Not even the filmmakers themselves expected Free Cinema to turn out as more than one screening; however, their films received such huge support and acclaim of both the audiences and art critiques that the a movement was launched. It was clear that the Free Cinema movement, although established to promote films “nobody would screen”, had touched on something essential.</p><h1 class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">We will screen two of these films: \\\"Momma Won't Allow\\\" and \\\"Together\\\".</h1>\",\"short_description\":\"1956: FREE CINEMA\",\"venue\":{},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-01-13T19:45:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-02-16T21:45:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"694946b284d0316a62c55fa4\",\"name\":\"Films of 1956\",\"color\":\"#08a6f1\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"trailer_url\":\"\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity\":0,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"694ecf35b5cfb77777041867\",\"name\":\"Watch online, Please make a donation to help us cover costs.\",\"price\":100,\"unlimited\":tr