iframe></div>\"}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-27T22:31:01.358Z\",\"is_virtual\":true,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":true,\"allow_preorder\":true,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_closed\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"virtual_balloting_consolidated\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":false,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":false,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":false,\"virtual_show_donate_prompt\":true,\"virtual_donate_message\":\"Support Sands Films Cinema Club and help cover our costs with an optional donation.\",\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[{\"url\":null,\"image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/dad6a51f117a7bc056bc8b25cfaa0f9c.png\"}],\"images\":{\"still\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1766856667265temp-1766856667234-default.jpg\"},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p><strong>Thank you for booking this online presentation.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>The link will be live some 15 minutes before the advertised time; it will remain active for 7 days for you to complete watching.</strong></p><p><strong>The Cinema Club has an alternative back up stream here: </strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sandsfilms.co.uk/the-cinema-club/next-screening-watch-live.html\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><strong>https://www.sandsfilms.co.uk/the-cinema-club/next-screening-watch-live.html</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Please feel free to send feedbacks, comments or complaints:</u> filmclub@sandsfilms.co.uk</strong></p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"695019ec180443850a3a2f76\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"1956: THE WRONG MAN: Sands Films Cinema Club online presentation\",\"description\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">This page is to obtain access to the broadcast of this Sands Films Cinema Club presentation</p><h1 class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>1956: THE WRONG MAN</strong></h1><p><br></p><h1 class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">Following eyewitness identifications a man (Henry Fonda, tremendous) is wrongly picked up by the police as an insurance office thief. Frighteningly combining arrogance and stupidity, the police seize on every opportunity to disprove the latter but each time confirm it. The passage where Manny is booked, incarcerated and, after a long night, arraigned in court encompasses Hitchcock’s most brilliant filmmaking. Almost pure pseudo-documentary, it is absolutely objective and, simultaneously, absolutely subjective—a profound revelation of Manny’s shame, distress and fear. Throughout the film, Robert Burks’s black-and-white cinematography blends documentary realism and dreamy noirishness.</h1><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p>\",\"short_description\":\"1956: THE WRONG MAN, Hitchcock’s most brilliant filmmaking\",\"venue\":{},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-02-03T19:45:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-03-09T21:45:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"694946b284d0316a62c55fa4\",\"name\":\"Films of 1956\",\"color\":\"#08a6f1\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"trailer_url\":\"\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity\":0,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"695019ec180443850a3a2f77\",\"name\":\"Watch online, Please make a donation t