></iframe></div>\"}],\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-27T18:12:24.218Z\",\"is_virtual\":true,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":true,\"allow_preorder\":true,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_closed\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"virtual_balloting_consolidated\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":false,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":false,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":false,\"virtual_show_donate_prompt\":true,\"virtual_donate_message\":\"Support Sands Films Cinema Club and help cover our costs with an optional donation.\",\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[{\"url\":null,\"image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/c58ee1c601b05c73c4fa78bfe8574397.png\"}],\"images\":{\"still\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1766859129068temp-1766859129029-default.jpg\"},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p><strong>Thank you for booking this online presentation.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>The link will be live some 15 minutes before the advertised time; it will remain active for 7 days for you to complete watching.</strong></p><p><strong>The Cinema Club has an alternative back up stream here: </strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sandsfilms.co.uk/the-cinema-club/next-screening-watch-live.html\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><strong>https://www.sandsfilms.co.uk/the-cinema-club/next-screening-watch-live.html</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Please feel free to send feedbacks, comments or complaints:</u> filmclub@sandsfilms.co.uk</strong></p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"69501066e7193f7b9d0e0a91\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"1956: MAN ON THE TRACKS\",\"description\":\"<p>RESERVE A SEAT to come in person</p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\\\">OR </strong><a href=\\\"https://watch.eventive.org/sandsfilms/play/69502121e4aeacb78e40f8d7\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\\\"><strong>CLICK HERE TO WATCH THE SCREENING ONLINE</strong></a></p><p>Viewers can watch when they want and are able to rewind or fast-forward</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h1 class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong class=\\\"ql-size-huge\\\">1956: MAN ON THE TRACKS</strong></h1><p><em class=\\\"ql-size-huge\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Man on the Tracks</em><span class=\\\"ql-size-huge\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">&nbsp;begins famously with a man’s death. The man is Orzechowski, a former railway conductor—an older man, who haunts the local station post. He is run down on the tracks by the very train he used to engineer, which his replacement, recognizing him, brings to a screeching halt. How did this happen? Two possibilities are suicide and sabotage.</span></p><p><span class=\\\"ql-size-huge\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Director Andrzej Munk died in a road accident in 1961, ending the career of the Polish filmmaker whom Roman Polanski considered his mentor.</span></p>\",\"short_description\":\"A true classic of modern Polish cinema\",\"location\":\"Sands Films Cinema\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"616324bd6f5b7b00459ce70e\",\"name\":\"Sands Films Cinema\",\"short_name\":\"Sands Cinema\",\"description\":\"Film preview theatre\",\"address\":\"82 St Marychurch Street\\nLondon, SE16 4HZ\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#23a833\",\"use_reserved_seating\":false,\"comscore_include\":true},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-02-17T20:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-02-17T22:00:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"694946b284d0316a62c55fa4\",\"name\":\"Films of 1956\",\"color\":\"#08a6f1\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":true,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity\":63,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"69501066e7193f7b9d0e0a92\",\"name\":\"No charge to reserve seat, instead, please make a donation to support our work and contribute to our costs.\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":63,\"quantity_sold\":23,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":40,\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"max_quantity_per_person\":3,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true},{\"id\":\"69501066e7193f7b9d0e0a93\",\"name\":\"\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity_sold\":0,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":9007199254740991,\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"653a28fed93ee8007364add5\"],\"is_active\":true}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6950233ac3d1fc0b9836ae26\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"Sands Films Studio\",\"owner_id\":\"60b1303f5955f7009b7cdff3\",\"name\":\"Man on the Tracks\",\"sort_key\":\"Man on the Tracks\",\"description\":\"One night in 1950 a passenger train runs over a man, who turns out to be the veteran train engineer Władysław Orzechowski, knows for his old ways and stern demeanor. As the inquiry panel tries to deduce why would a man like Orzechowski jump in front of a moving train several of the people involved in the case are interrogated, each telling their own version of the story. Can the panel arrive at the truth in a world where workers unite, inferior coal is a badge of honor, and the old order is suspect?\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/958d5be47b2413207a611c7233475fc2.jpg?fit=crop&w=960&h=380\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/d4431d34d49d74d7ec7505a9de42d011.jpg?w=300\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/2c7c3aa03bf7228139b3fb597a5b5d71.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"language\":\"Polish\",\"runtime\":\"81\",\"year\":\"1957\"},\"credits\":{\"animator\":null,\"cast\":\"Kazimierz Opaliński, Zygmunt Maciejewski, Zygmunt Zintel\",\"cinematographer\":\"Romuald Kropat\",\"co_producer\":null,\"composer\":null,\"director\":\"Andrzej Munk\",\"editor\":\"Jadwiga Zajiček\",\"executive_producer\":null,\"filmmaker\":null,\"music\":null,\"producer\":null,\"production_design\":\"Roman Mann\",\"screenwriter\":\"Andrzej Munk, Jerzy Stefan Stawiński\",\"sound_design\":null},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[],\"imdb_id\":\"tt0050282\",\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2025-12-27T18:19:38.608Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-27T18:20:03.252Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-27T18:32:53.769Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{\"cover\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1766860374703temp-1766860374655-cover.jpg\",\"avatar\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1766860374888temp-1766860374854-avatar.jpg\"},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for reserving a seat at Sands Films Cinema Club.</p><p><br></p><p>Should you decide to cancel your attendance please email <a href=\\\"mailto:filmclub@sandsfilms.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">filmclub@sandsfilms.co.uk</a></p><p>We will send you an online access instead so you can watch the film live or later at a convenient time and will make your seat available to someone else.</p><p>Thank you for your support and your donation.</p><p><br></p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"6950220410716001def3cff0\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"1956: EARLY SPRING: Sands Films Cinema Club online presentation\",\"description\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">This page is to obtain access to the broadcast of this Sands Films Cinema Club presentation</p><h1 class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\">1956: EARLY SPRING</strong></h1><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\">Three years in its making,&nbsp;<em>Sōshun&nbsp;</em>(<em>Early Spring</em>, 1956) follows Yasujirō Ozu’s classic&nbsp;<em>Tōkyō monogatari</em>&nbsp;(<em>Tokyo Story</em>, 1953) in continuing to develop the director’s characteristic themes, including the demands of family life in modern post war Japan, the maintenance of tradition, the personal and professional obligations of the individual and the impact of changing times on people.</strong></p>\",\"short_description\":\"1956: Ozu's EARLY SPRING\",\"venue\":{},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-02-24T19:45:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-03-30T21:45:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"694946b284d0316a62c55fa4\",\"name\":\"Films of 1956\",\"color\":\"#08a6f1\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"