\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(15, 15, 15);\\\">Sōshun&nbsp;</em><span class=\\\"ql-size-huge\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(15, 15, 15);\\\">(</span><em class=\\\"ql-size-huge\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(15, 15, 15);\\\">Early Spring</em><span class=\\\"ql-size-huge\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(15, 15, 15);\\\">, 1956) follows Yasujirō Ozu’s classic&nbsp;</span><em class=\\\"ql-size-huge\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(15, 15, 15);\\\">Tōkyō monogatari</em><span class=\\\"ql-size-huge\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(15, 15, 15);\\\">&nbsp;(</span><em class=\\\"ql-size-huge\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(15, 15, 15);\\\">Tokyo Story</em><span class=\\\"ql-size-huge\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(15, 15, 15);\\\">, 1953) in continuing to develop the director’s characteristic themes, including the demands of family life in modern post war Japan, the maintenance of tradition, the personal and professional obligations of the individual and the impact of changing times on people.</span></p>\",\"short_description\":\"Yasujirō Ozu’s reflections on modern Japan\",\"location\":\"Sands Films Cinema\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"616324bd6f5b7b00459ce70e\",\"name\":\"Sands Films Cinema\",\"short_name\":\"Sands Cinema\",\"description\":\"Film preview theatre\",\"address\":\"82 St Marychurch Street\\nLondon, SE16 4HZ\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#23a833\",\"use_reserved_seating\":false,\"comscore_include\":true},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-02-24T20:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-02-24T22:00:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"694946b284d0316a62c55fa4\",\"name\":\"Films of 1956\",\"color\":\"#08a6f1\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"dis